---
---

<header class="space-y-5">
  <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-end justify-between gap-5 border-b border-base-content/15 pb-6">
    <div class="space-y-2">
      <a
        href="/manos-a-la-obra"
        class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs sm:text-sm font-heading text-secondary hover:text-secondary/80 hover:-translate-x-0.5 transition-all focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-secondary/50 rounded-lg py-0.5"
      >
        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-4 h-4 shrink-0" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2">
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M10.5 19.5 3 12m0 0 7.5-7.5M3 12h18" />
        </svg>
        <span>Volver a Manos a la Obra</span>
      </a>

      <h1 class="font-display text-secondary text-[clamp(2.1rem,4.8vw,3.4rem)] leading-none tracking-tight">
        INSCRIPCIÓN MO 2026
      </h1>

      <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 pt-0.5 text-xs sm:text-sm font-sans text-base-content/85">
        <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 bg-base-200/90 border border-base-content/10 px-3 py-1 rounded-full">
          <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5 text-secondary shrink-0" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M6.75 3v2.25M17.25 3v2.25M3 18.75V7.5a2.25 2.25 0 0 1 2.25-2.25h13.5A2.25 2.25 0 0 1 21 7.5v11.25m-18 0A2.25 2.25 0 0 0 5.25 21h13.5A2.25 2.25 0 0 0 21 18.75m-18 0v-7.5A2.25 2.25 0 0 1 5.25 9h13.5A2.25 2.25 0 0 1 21 11.25v7.5" />
          </svg>
          26 al 30 de Diciembre de 2026
        </span>
        <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 bg-base-200/90 border border-base-content/10 px-3 py-1 rounded-full">
          <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5 text-secondary shrink-0" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M15 10.5a3 3 0 1 1-6 0 3 3 0 0 1 6 0Z" />
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M19.5 10.5c0 7.142-7.5 11.25-7.5 11.25S4.5 17.642 4.5 10.5a7.5 7.5 0 1 1 15 0Z" />
          </svg>
          Carrodilla
        </span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div
      role="tablist"
      aria-label="Modalidad de registro"
      class="tabs tabs-box bg-base-200/90 border border-base-content/15 rounded-2xl p-1.5 shadow-inner self-start md:self-end shrink-0"
    >
      <button
        type="button"
        role="tab"
        id="tab-nueva"
        aria-selected="true"
        aria-controls="wizard-wrapper"
        class="tab tab-active font-heading text-xs sm:text-sm px-4 py-2 rounded-xl transition-all flex items-center gap-2 cursor-pointer"
      >
        <svg class="w-4 h-4 shrink-0 opacity-80" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 4.5v15m7.5-7.5h-15" />
        </svg>
        <span>Nueva inscripción</span>
      </button>
      <button
        type="button"
        role="tab"
        id="tab-consulta"
        aria-selected="false"
        aria-controls="consulta-wrapper"
        class="tab font-heading text-xs sm:text-sm px-4 py-2 rounded-xl transition-all flex items-center gap-2 cursor-pointer"
      >
        <svg class="w-4 h-4 shrink-0 opacity-80" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="m21 21-5.197-5.197m0 0A7.5 7.5 0 1 0 5.196 5.196a7.5 7.5 0 0 0 10.607 10.607Z" />
        </svg>
        <span>Ya me inscribí</span>
      </button>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div id="closed-banner" class="hidden bg-warning/15 border border-warning/30 text-base-content rounded-2xl p-4 sm:p-5 flex items-start gap-3.5 shadow-sm">
    <div class="p-2 bg-warning/20 text-warning rounded-xl shrink-0">
      <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
        <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 9v3.75m9-.75a9 9 0 1 1-18 0 9 9 0 0 1 18 0Zm-9 3.75h.008v.008H12v-.008Z" />
      </svg>
    </div>
    <div class="space-y-1 text-sm">
      <p class="font-heading text-base font-bold text-warning-content">Inscripciones generales cerradas</p>
      <p class="text-base-content/85">
        El período de nuevas inscripciones generales ha concluido por el momento. Si ya realizaste tu registro, podés consultar tu estado y subir tu documentación desde la pestaña <strong>Ya me inscribí</strong>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</header>
